/*
  LiveTelemetryPanels.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0281 · LiveTelemetryPanels (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `LiveTelemetryPanels` (its seven panel projections + the live-section chrome)
  resolves (table "LiveTelemetryPanels") lives here with its web English value.
  These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at
  integration time; they are kept in a per-surface table so each parallel surface
  prompt owns its own strings without editing the shared catalog.

  The `common.*` + `telemetry.*` keys mirror the web source's `t(key, default)`
  calls across LiveTelemetryPanels.tsx and the seven panels it composes
  (PowertrainPanel / ClimatePanel / SecurityPanel / VehicleStatePanel /
  TirePressurePanel / EnergyChargingPanel / MediaNavigationPanel) VERBATIM. Web
  literals that were hardcoded in VehicleStatePanel / TirePressurePanel (no `t()`)
  are promoted to keys here so the native surface holds zero English literals. The
  `liveTelemetry.*` keys back the standardized P4 chrome (freshness chip, relative
  age, loading / empty / error states, banners) the leaf contract requires.
*/


